{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on Colonel Bach, the first boss you'll face from the Iron Legion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669470/extras/Gameplay_Banner.png?t=1748331741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669470/extras/MetalGenesis_GIF_CBach_Phase_02_Compressed.gif?t=1748331741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-Paced Mech Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a rebel leader controlling a squad of three mechs, each with a different arsenal. Swap between mechs mid-combat and use their unique strengths tactically to overcome your foes!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669470/extras/Stage1-04-Boss-Intro.png?t=1748331741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging Boss Fights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take down gargantuan mech bosses in a series of action-packed battles! Understand the enemy, execute evasive maneuvers, and exploit every weakness you find.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669470/extras/MetalGenesis_GIF_CBach_Gattai_02_Compressed.gif?t=1748331741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Ultimate Fusion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine your mechs through the power of Gattai! Together, you\u2019re unstoppable.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669470?t=1748331741","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app